WEBVTT

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:04.030
And as I'm in the midst of my deep dive,

00:09:04.063 --> 00:09:05.330
I realize

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:09.030
I had to learn how to let paint dry.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.463
I have to stop

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:15.697
and take a break,

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:16.997
because if I don't,

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:21.097
my yellows and my blues will make green,

00:09:21.097 --> 00:09:23.930
even if that's not
what I really, really want.

00:09:27.563 --> 00:09:30.063
And then I started to think about
all the other times